      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The flier who flies a hand-painted dragon and $12 are exactly one fee step apart in entry fee order, in one direction or the other. (b) The flier who uses waxed cotton is cheaper than the flier who flies a hand-painted dragon in entry fee order.",
      "$4 is exactly one fee step cheaper than the flier who flies a hand-painted dragon, with no entry fee in between.",
