      "The following two do NOT both hold; either one alone may hold, and so may neither: (a) Aurelio and the flier who is undone by a lost tail are exactly one fee step apart in entry fee order, in one direction or the other. (b) The flier who uses kevlar thread is dearer than $2 in entry fee order.",
